{"parse": {"title": "Polty", "pageid": 24009, "revid": 311379, "redirects": [], "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-stacked\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\"><div class=\"infobox2-slideshow dlc-slideshow\"><div class=\"infobox2-slide\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"P\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/b/bd/Font_TeamMeat_P.png/revision/latest?cb=20210822055823\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"23\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Font TeamMeat P.png\" data-image-key=\"Font_TeamMeat_P.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"o\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/e/e3/Font_TeamMeat_o.png/revision/latest?cb=20210822060902\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Font TeamMeat o.png\" data-image-key=\"Font_TeamMeat_o.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"l\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/0/04/Font_TeamMeat_l.png/revision/latest?cb=20210822060746\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Font TeamMeat l.png\" data-image-key=\"Font_TeamMeat_l.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"t\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Font TeamMeat t.png\" data-image-key=\"Font_TeamMeat_t.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/b/b0/Font_TeamMeat_t.png/revision/latest?cb=20210822061104\" /></span></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"y\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"17\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Font TeamMeat y.png\" data-image-key=\"Font_TeamMeat_y.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/6/6b/Font_TeamMeat_y.png/revision/latest?cb=20210822061303\" /></span></span></span></div></div></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Entity Image</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"infobox2-slideshow dlc-slideshow\"><div class=\"infobox2-slide\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Entity image\"><img alt=\"Entity image\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"66\" height=\"78\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Polty.png\" data-image-key=\"Polty.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/b/b0/Polty.png/revision/latest?cb=20210408215815\" /></span></span></div></div><br /></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-smart-group pi-border-color\">\n    \n        <section class=\"pi-smart-group-head pi-border-color\">\n            \n                <h3 class=\"pi-smart-data-label pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" style=\"width: calc(1 / 2 * 100%);\" data-source=\"base hp\">Base HP</h3>\n            \n                <h3 class=\"pi-smart-data-label pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" style=\"width: calc(1 / 2 * 100%);\" data-source=\"stage hp\">Stage HP</h3>\n            \n        </section>\n    \n    <section class=\"pi-smart-group-body pi-border-color\">\n        \n            <div class=\"pi-smart-data-value pi-data-value pi-font pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" style=\"width: calc(1 / 2 * 100%);\" data-source=\"base hp\"><div class=\"infobox2-slideshow dlc-slideshow\"><div class=\"infobox2-slide\"> <span class=\"pi-custom-font\">14</span></div></div></div>\n        \n            <div class=\"pi-smart-data-value pi-data-value pi-font pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" style=\"width: calc(1 / 2 * 100%);\" data-source=\"stage hp\"><div class=\"infobox2-slideshow dlc-slideshow\"><div class=\"infobox2-slide\"> <span class=\"pi-custom-font\">2.5</span></div></div></div>\n        \n    </section>\n</section>\n\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"id\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Entity ID</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><code>816.0</code></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"environment\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Found In</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Downpour\" title=\"Downpour\"><img alt=\"Stage Downpour icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Downpour icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Downpour_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/3/3f/Stage_Downpour_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210825113950\" /></a></span><br /><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cathedral\" title=\"Cathedral\"><img alt=\"Stage Cathedral icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Cathedral icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Cathedral_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/e/e3/Stage_Cathedral_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210826072841\" /></a></span><br /><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Boss_Room\" title=\"Boss Room\"><img alt=\"Boss Room Icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"27\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Boss Room Icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Boss_Room_Icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/3/30/Boss_Room_Icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210821102031\" /></a></span><br />Spawned by <a href=\"/wiki/Haunted_Chest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Haunted Chest\">Haunted Chests</a></div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><div id=\"context-page\" class=\"context-box\"><span class=\"mw-default-size dlc dlc-8\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Added in Repentance\"><img alt=\"(in Repentance)\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dlc r indicator.png\" data-image-key=\"Dlc_r_indicator.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/f/f2/Dlc_r_indicator.png/revision/latest?cb=20210815090252\" /></span></span> </div>\n<p><b>Polty</b> is an enemy added in <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Binding_of_Isaac:_Repentance\" title=\"The Binding of Isaac: Repentance\">The Binding of Isaac: Repentance</a></i>. \n</p><p>Unlike normal enemies, Polties appear from inside <a href=\"/wiki/Rocks#Buckets\" title=\"Rocks\">Buckets</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Rocks#Urns\" title=\"Rocks\">Urns</a> in the current room. They then pick up the obstacle they were under, fly towards Isaac, and then throw it at him. For the rest of the room, it will fly around the room, stopping to pick up more rocks, props, <a href=\"/wiki/Poops\" title=\"Poops\">poops</a>, and other obstacles and throw them at Isaac. Thrown obstacles have the same chance to release pickups or enemies as if they had been destroyed normally. Once there are no more rocks to throw at Isaac, they will leave the room.\n</p><p>Polties prefer to pick up <a href=\"/wiki/Rocks#Buckets\" title=\"Rocks\">Buckets</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/TNT\" title=\"TNT\">TNT</a> over normal rocks, with the exception of <a href=\"/wiki/Blocks\" title=\"Blocks\">Metal Blocks</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Rocks#Spiked_Rocks\" title=\"Rocks\">Spiked Rocks</a>, which they cannot pick up. If there's a <a href=\"/wiki/Rocks#Tinted_Rocks\" title=\"Rocks\">Tinted Rock</a>, it will avoid picking it up until there's no other rocks left to throw. When it finally does pick it up, it will fly offscreen with it instead of throwing it at Isaac. If the Polty is killed before it successfully runs away with the rock, it will give its contents like normal.\n</p><p>Destroying the Bucket or Urn which a Polty is hiding beneath will cause it to spawn and then behave normally.\n</p><p>Once <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Haunted_Chest\" title=\"Haunted Chest\"><img alt=\"Haunted Chest\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Achievement Haunted Chest icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Achievement_Haunted_Chest_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/b/b8/Achievement_Haunted_Chest_icon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210822144626\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Haunted_Chest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Haunted Chest\">Haunted Chests</a> are unlocked, Polties may be encountered anywhere. After being spawned by approaching the chest, they grab it and throw it at Isaac, then act normally.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both\"></div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Variants\">Variants</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Kineti\">Kineti</span></h3><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-stacked\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\"><div class=\"infobox2-slideshow dlc-slideshow\"><div class=\"infobox2-slide\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"K\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Font TeamMeat K.png\" data-image-key=\"Font_TeamMeat_K.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/a/a4/Font_TeamMeat_K.png/revision/latest?cb=20210822055625\" /></span></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"i\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"8\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Font TeamMeat i.png\" data-image-key=\"Font_TeamMeat_i.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/b/b0/Font_TeamMeat_i.png/revision/latest?cb=20210822060636\" /></span></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"n\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"17\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Font TeamMeat n.png\" data-image-key=\"Font_TeamMeat_n.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/0/04/Font_TeamMeat_n.png/revision/latest?cb=20210822060837\" /></span></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"e\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"18\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Font TeamMeat e.png\" data-image-key=\"Font_TeamMeat_e.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/8/8a/Font_TeamMeat_e.png/revision/latest?cb=20210822060501\" /></span></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"t\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Font TeamMeat t.png\" data-image-key=\"Font_TeamMeat_t.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/b/b0/Font_TeamMeat_t.png/revision/latest?cb=20210822061104\" /></span></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"i\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"8\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Font TeamMeat i.png\" data-image-key=\"Font_TeamMeat_i.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/b/b0/Font_TeamMeat_i.png/revision/latest?cb=20210822060636\" /></span></span></span></div></div></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Entity Image</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"infobox2-slideshow dlc-slideshow\"><div class=\"infobox2-slide\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Entity image\"><img alt=\"Entity image\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"66\" height=\"105\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Kineti.png\" data-image-key=\"Kineti.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/5/52/Kineti.png/revision/latest?cb=20210408220026\" /></span></span></div></div><br /></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-smart-group pi-border-color\">\n    \n        <section class=\"pi-smart-group-head pi-border-color\">\n            \n                <h3 class=\"pi-smart-data-label pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" style=\"width: calc(1 / 2 * 100%);\" data-source=\"base hp\">Base HP</h3>\n            \n                <h3 class=\"pi-smart-data-label pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" style=\"width: calc(1 / 2 * 100%);\" data-source=\"stage hp\">Stage HP</h3>\n            \n        </section>\n    \n    <section class=\"pi-smart-group-body pi-border-color\">\n        \n            <div class=\"pi-smart-data-value pi-data-value pi-font pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" style=\"width: calc(1 / 2 * 100%);\" data-source=\"base hp\"><div class=\"infobox2-slideshow dlc-slideshow\"><div class=\"infobox2-slide\"> <span class=\"pi-custom-font\">45</span></div></div></div>\n        \n            <div class=\"pi-smart-data-value pi-data-value pi-font pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" style=\"width: calc(1 / 2 * 100%);\" data-source=\"stage hp\"><div class=\"infobox2-slideshow dlc-slideshow\"><div class=\"infobox2-slide\"> <span class=\"pi-custom-font\">3</span></div></div></div>\n        \n    </section>\n</section>\n\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"id\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Entity ID</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><code>816.1</code></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"environment\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Found In</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mausoleum\" title=\"Mausoleum\"><img alt=\"Stage Mausoleum icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Mausoleum icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Mausoleum_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/8/80/Stage_Mausoleum_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210825172400\" /></a></span></div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><div class=\"context-box\"><span class=\"mw-default-size dlc dlc-8\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Added in Repentance\"><img alt=\"(in Repentance)\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dlc r indicator.png\" data-image-key=\"Dlc_r_indicator.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/f/f2/Dlc_r_indicator.png/revision/latest?cb=20210815090252\" /></span></span> </div>\n<p><b>Kineti</b> is the <span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mausoleum\" title=\"Mausoleum\"><img alt=\"Mausoleum\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Mausoleum icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Mausoleum_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/8/80/Stage_Mausoleum_icon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210825172400\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Mausoleum\" title=\"Mausoleum\">Mausoleum</a> variant of a Polty and behave similarly to their counterpart, with the exception that they use telekinesis to bring <a href=\"/wiki/Obstacles\" title=\"Obstacles\">obstacles</a> toward them rather than moving towards them and picking them up manually. The obstacles can damage Isaac while being pulled towards the Kineti.\n</p><p><b>Kinetis</b> will prioritize picking up rocks that would hit Isaac while being pulled towards itself. They are also knocked back by the force of the rock they carry once it enters their hands. If there are no more obstacles for them to pick up, similar to Polties, they will exit the room, and if they choose to pick up a Tinted Rock, they will fly offscreen with it instead of throwing it at Isaac.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>The <a href=\"https://antibirth.fandom.com/wiki/Polty\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"anti:Polty\">Polty</a> first appeared in the <i>Antibirth</i> mod where it had 20 hp and 3 stage hp.</li>\n<li>\"Polty\" is a nickname of the word \"poltergeist\" as it behaves quite similarly to one. In lore, poltergeists are known to be <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Poltergeist\">\"responsible for physical disturbances, such as loud noises and objects being moved or destroyed.\"</a></li>\n<li>\"Kineti\" is a shortened version of the word \"<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kinetic_energy\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Kinetic energy\">kinetic</a>,\" which describes the form of energy that an object possesses due to its motion.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\">Bugs</span></h2>\n<table class=\"bug\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th><span class=\"mw-default-size inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Bug\"><img alt=\"Bug\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Collectible Undefined icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Collectible_Undefined_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/2/2e/Collectible_Undefined_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20221115212719\" /></span></span> Bug!\n</th>\n<td>Petrifying Kinetis while they are pulling a rock towards them causes the rock to keep flying and can cause it to fly out of the room.<span class=\"dlc-context-pop\"></span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br class=\"content-filter-end\" /></p><div class=\"nav-start\" style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n<table class=\"nav-box nav-main\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th class=\"nav-title\"><span class=\"no-alt\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"SmallIsaac\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"SmallIsaac.png\" data-image-key=\"SmallIsaac.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/a/a6/SmallIsaac.png/revision/latest?cb=20210821194340\" /></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Binding_of_Isaac:_Rebirth_Wiki\" title=\"Binding of Isaac: Rebirth Wiki\">The Binding of Isaac: Rebirth</a><span class=\"no-alt\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"SmallIsaac\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" heigh